":[{"name":"Swami","relatedModules":["SwiftUICore"]}],"externalID":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewPAAE4helpyQrqd__SyRd__lF::SYNTHESIZED::s:5Swami20Interaction_DragViewV","platforms":[{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"14.0","name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"14.0","name":"iPadOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"14.0","name":"Mac Catalyst","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"11.0","name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"14.0","name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"7.0","name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false}],"role":"symbol"},"abstract":[{"text":"Inherited from ","type":"text"},{"code":"View.help(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","title":"Interaction_DragView","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_